// NOTE (build failure, 2026-10-31): the F.26 prebuilt libbluetooth_audio_session was REMOVED.
// It was declared with prefer: true, so Soong chose it over base's SOURCE module
// (hardware/interfaces/bluetooth/audio/utils/Android.bp -> cc_library_shared { vendor: true,
// export_include_dirs: ["session/"] }). A prebuilt exports no headers, so
// packages/modules/Bluetooth/system/audio_bluetooth_hw/device_port_proxy_hidl.cc could not find
// BluetoothAudioSessionControl_2_1.h. Evidence: the failing compile carried
// -I.../bluetooth/audio/utils/aidl_session but NOT -I.../bluetooth/audio/utils/session, and
// "libbluetooth_audio_session" appears 0 times in the entire build log (prebuilts are copied,
