// NOTE (link failure, 2026-10-31): REMOVED the F.26 prebuilt libcld80211.
// The CAF source tree (hardware/qcom-caf/wlan/cld80211-lib) builds libcld80211, and the
// in-tree qcwcn wifi_hal.cpp (whole-statically linked into AOSP libwifi-hal) references
// cld80211_get_nl_socket_ctx -- a symbol our F.26-era prebuilt does NOT export. The
// prebuilt shadowed the source module (prefer: true), so the link failed with:
//   undefined symbol: cld80211_get_nl_socket_ctx
// Same class as c97abc1 (drop base-provided prebuilts). Guarded by lint C81 (no prebuilt may prefer over a base source module) and C82 (install-path collision scan).

